  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing accountability in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s objective is to protect and promote access to justice and to increase accountability by supporting Libyan human rights lawyers, and raising awareness on human rights challenges within the Libyan legal system. The project will increase the access of victims of human rights violations to networks of legal support, allowing them to defend their case, seek protection and access justice in front of national and international courts.</narrative>
  </description>
